From behind Marc — seen over his shoulder, cropped at the collar of his green waxed jacket showing his combed short wavy dark brown hair — Marc crouches on the grey rock shelf at the reef's edge, both of his palms raised flat outward in a warning gesture, his face turned away into the frame, brows tense with wide anxious eyes. Across a few paces of wet sand at the shore, Jules — a young school-age boy with combed short straight dark brown hair, blue eyes, wearing a red hooded sweatshirt, grey cotton shorts-length jogger trousers, and white canvas sneakers — stands facing him at the water's edge, gazing back at Marc with level brows, steady attentive eyes, and a closed calm mouth. The wet sand stretches between them under the clear afternoon sky, with dune grass at the top of the beach and the pale coral ridge extending into the water beyond.

---METADATA---
