Under the bright sunlit water, Jules — a young school-age boy with combed short straight dark brown hair, bangs above his eyebrows, blue eyes, wearing a short-sleeve blue swim shirt and one smooth shimmering green mermaid tail replacing his legs from the waist down, ending in a broad fin — swims energetically mid-stroke toward the pale orange and rose coral arch in the center of the frame. His body stretches horizontally through the clear blue water, his arms reaching forward and his green tail curving in a powerful kick, his eyes fixed eagerly on the arch ahead, brows arched high, and mouth parted in a wide delighted grin. The coral arch rises from the reef wall to adult height, framed by knobbed rose coral ridges over a sandy hollow scattered with broken coral crumbs on the seabed. Medium underwater shot showing Jules speeding through the clear sea toward the arch.

---METADATA---
